================================================================================

Nothing below is redistributed in this package. These entries record where
*ideas and mathematics* came from, and — where a file is a derivation — which
upstream file it derives from. The audit behind this list is in
dossier/README.md.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
state-spaces/s4 — Apache License 2.0
https://github.com/state-spaces/s4

src/torch_dimensions/mixers/ssm.py derives the S4D and S4 (DPLR) kernel
mathematics from `models/s4/s4d.py` and the structured-kernel modules.
Modified: the fused CUDA/Triton kernels, the pytorch_lightning and hub
imports, and the transposed-layout plumbing are not carried over, and a
Nyquist-pole guard was added that upstream does not have. That file's module
docstring states this in full, as Apache-2.0 section 4(b) asks.

Upstream ships no NOTICE file, so there is none to propagate.

